          "id": 1021357081,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Not an HTTP2 expert; I simply copied the HTTP logic.\n\nPlease note that I had do disable the commit hook to avoid these errors (no idea why they show up)\n```\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_accept\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_accept_charset\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_accept_encoding\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_accept_language\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_accept_ranges\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_access_control_allow_origin\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_age\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_allow\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_authority\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_authorization\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_cache_control\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_content_disposition\nUnused href entry: epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: hf_http2_headers_content_encod\n[...]\n```",
